        "responses": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are an actionable output agent for railway engineering requirements (GSM-R to FRMCS migration context).\n\nGiven the requirements below, for each one assign:\n\n1. \"owner\": the responsible stakeholder:\n   - ERA: regulatory and interoperability requirements\n   - Infrastructure Manager: trackside equipment and coverage\n   - Train Operator: onboard equipment and driver-facing functionality\n   - Vendor: implementation, technical compliance, and software\n\n2. \"evidenceType\": type of evidence needed to verify it:\n   - Test report\n   - Design document\n   - Standard reference\n   - Inspection record\n   - Simulation result\n   - Certification document\n\n3. \"ownerConfidence\": high, medium, or low\n\n4. \"priority\": high, medium, or low — based on safety criticality and reviewStatus\n\n5. \"actionNote\": one sentence describing the next concrete action needed\n\nReturn a JSON array where each object contains ALL original fields plus: owner, evidenceType, ownerConfidence, priority, actionNote.\nReturn ONLY the JSON array. Start with [ and end with ]\nNo explanation, no markdown fences.\n\nRequirements:\n{{ $json.allRequirements }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "simplify": false,
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {
          "maxTokens": 4000
        }
      },
