              "content": "=You are a design brief writer for railway engineering projects (GSM-R to FRMCS migration context).\n\nGiven the structured requirements below, write a concise feature and design brief that:\n\n1. Summarises the key functional areas covered by the requirements\n2. Highlights the most critical requirements (priority = high)\n3. Flags any conflicts or mismatches that need resolution before design can proceed\n4. Lists the main stakeholder owners and their responsibilities\n5. Ends with a short paragraph on recommended next steps\n\nWrite in clear professional prose. Use headings. Do not return JSON.\n\nRequirements:\n{{ $json.allRequirements }}"
